{"id":"6e0ceb35e6a34f4f","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-lexicographic-path-order.md","title":"LPO","display":"LPO","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","display":"LPO","label":"56-df-lexicographic-path-order","aliases":["56-df-lexicographic-path-order"],"type":"definition","depends_on":["[[56-df-recursive-path-order]]","[[56-df-lexicographic-extension]]"],"source_section":"6.4.2–6.4.4","source_pages":"211","source_ocr_blocks":[232],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"display","html":"LPO"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-lexicographic-path-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-lexicographic-path-order</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eafb5a2123c30027\" href=\"?note=eafb5a2123c30027\" title=\"56-df-recursive-path-order\">56-df-recursive-path-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"45ad3c4764af1fc0\" href=\"?note=45ad3c4764af1fc0\" title=\"56-df-lexicographic-extension\">56-df-lexicographic-extension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.4.2–6.4.4"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"211"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>232</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eafb5a2123c30027\" href=\"?note=eafb5a2123c30027\" title=\"56-df-recursive-path-order\">56-df-recursive-path-order</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,V,\\succ\">\\(\\Sigma,V,\\succ\\)</span>。为每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span> 选择 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_f\\in\\mathrm{Sym}([\\mathrm{ar}(f)])\">\\(\\pi_f\\in\\mathrm{Sym}([\\mathrm{ar}(f)])\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stat}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Stat}_n\\)</span> 的编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"45ad3c4764af1fc0\" href=\"?note=45ad3c4764af1fc0\" title=\"56-df-lexicographic-extension\">56-df-lexicographic-extension</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\pi}(f):=(1,\\pi_f),\\qquad\n&gt;_{\\mathrm{lpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\pi}:=\n&gt;_{\\mathrm{rpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau_{\\pi}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_{\\pi}(f):=(1,\\pi_f),\\qquad\n&gt;_{\\mathrm{lpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\pi}:=\n&gt;_{\\mathrm{rpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau_{\\pi}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Definition 6.4.4 把所有函数符号都取字典序 status 的递归路径序称为 LPO；允许各符号指定参数优先排列。通常的从左到右 LPO 取所有 π_f 为恒等排列。旧稿的定义右端为空，现通过已构造的 RPO 给出完整定义。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.4.2–6.4.4，印刷页 211。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本层提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-recursive-path-order","status":"resolved","id":"eafb5a2123c30027","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-recursive-path-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lexicographic-extension","status":"resolved","id":"45ad3c4764af1fc0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-lexicographic-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-recursive-path-order","status":"resolved","id":"eafb5a2123c30027","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-recursive-path-order]] 的 $\\Sigma,V,\\succ$。为每个 $f\\in F$ 选择 $\\pi_f\\in\\mathrm{Sym}([\\mathrm{ar}(f)])$；$\\mathrm{Stat}_n$ 的编码见 [[56-df-lexicographic-extension]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lexicographic-extension","status":"resolved","id":"45ad3c4764af1fc0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-recursive-path-order]] 的 $\\Sigma,V,\\succ$。为每个 $f\\in F$ 选择 $\\pi_f\\in\\mathrm{Sym}([\\mathrm{ar}(f)])$；$\\mathrm{Stat}_n$ 的编码见 [[56-df-lexicographic-extension]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,V,\\succ","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_f\\in\\mathrm{Sym}([\\mathrm{ar}(f)])","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stat}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\pi}(f):=(1,\\pi_f),\\qquad\n>_{\\mathrm{lpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\pi}:=\n>_{\\mathrm{rpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau_{\\pi}}.","display":true}],"bytes":1312,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-210","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-lexicographic-path-order.md]]"},{"id":"910eea2993769cc6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$。沿用 [[56-df-lexicographic-path-order]] 的严格 precedence $\\succ$ 和参数优先排列 $\\pi$；假设 $\\mathrm{WF}(F,\\succ)$ 及 $\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;(l>_{\\mathrm{lpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\pi}r)$。"},{"id":"b8687a62bc9cda64","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-lexicographic-path-order]] 的 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar}),V,\\succ,\\pi$；假设 $\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(F,\\succ)$ 及 $\\mathrm{WF}(F,\\succ)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$。"}],"outgoing":["eafb5a2123c30027","45ad3c4764af1fc0"]}